{%- comment -%}
  Petsome Ld: scroll anchor.

  Renders a stable, human-readable jump target for a section, e.g. "#reasons".

  Do NOT use Shopify's own "#shopify-section-<id>" wrapper for this. In a JSON
  template that id is not the section's key - it is prefixed with the template,
  e.g. "shopify-section-template--30955182424389__reasons" - so any hand-written
  link to "#shopify-section-reasons" silently points at nothing, and the number
  changes between templates and themes.

  Usage: {% render 'petsome-ld-anchor', id: section.settings.anchor_id %}

  The inline style keeps it self-contained, so the snippet can be dropped into
  any section without that section needing a matching CSS rule.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign anchor_id = id | strip | replace: '#', '' -%}
{%- if anchor_id != blank -%}
  <div
    id="{{ anchor_id | escape }}"
    class="petsome-ld-anchor"
    aria-hidden="true"
    style="display:block;scroll-margin-top:20px"
  ></div>
{%- endif -%}
